cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MEVA in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "MEVA — Medical Evidence Verification Agent"
abstract: >
  MEVA is an open-source research and engineering framework for evaluating
  whether AI agents retrieve and faithfully use medical evidence from
  synthetic FHIR records, using a deterministic (non-AI) evidence verifier.
  It is not clinically validated and is not a medical device.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-17"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Tanz2024/meva-health-ai"
url: "https://github.com/Tanz2024/meva-health-ai"
authors:
  - name: "Tanzim Bin Zahir"
keywords:
  - fhir
  - healthcare-ai
  - llm-evaluation
  - benchmark
  - synthetic-data
  - model-context-protocol
  - evidence-grounding
